| 16 | 8 | 14/7 = 2 | ✓ | ✓ ($2^4$: $\{1,3,5,\dots,15\}$) |
| 17 | 16 | 15/15 = 1 | ✓ | ✓ (prime) |
| 18 | 6 | 16/5 | ✗ | — |
| 19 | 18 | 17/17 = 1 | ✓ | ✓ (prime) |
| 20 | 8 | 18/7 | ✗ | — |
